    {
      "source": "You can help make Spring Data best serve the needs of the Spring community by interacting with developers on Stack Overflow at either\n<a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-data\">spring-data</a> or <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-data-redis\">spring-data-redis</a>.",
      "translation": "您可以通过在 Stack Overflow 上与开发者互动，帮助 Spring Data 更好地满足 Spring 社区的需求。您可以在以下标签下进行提问或回答：\n<a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-data\">spring-data</a> 或 <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-data-redis\">spring-data-redis</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Lastly, you can follow the Spring <a href=\"https://spring.io/blog/\">blog</a> or the project team (<a href=\"https://twitter.com/SpringData\">@SpringData</a>) on Twitter.",
      "translation": "最后，您可以关注 Spring 的<a href=\"https://spring.io/blog/\">博客</a>，或在 Twitter 上关注项目团队（<a href=\"https://twitter.com/SpringData\">@SpringData</a>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data uses Spring framework’s\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core.html\">core</a> functionality, including:",
      "translation": "Spring Data 使用了 Spring 框架的\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core.html\">核心</a>功能，包括：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core.html#validation\">type conversion system</a>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core.html#validation\">类型转换系统</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core.html#expressions\">expression language</a>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core.html#expressions\">表达式语言</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/integration.html#jmx\">JMX integration</a>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/integration.html#jmx\">JMX 集成</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/data-access.html#dao-exceptions\">DAO exception hierarchy</a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/data-access.html#dao-exceptions\">DAO 异常层次结构</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The core functionality of the Redis support can be used directly, with no need to invoke the IoC services of the Spring Container.\nThis is much like <code>JdbcTemplate</code>, which can be used \"'standalone'\" without any other services of the Spring container.\nTo leverage all the features of Spring Data Redis, such as the repository support, you need to configure some parts of the library to use Spring.",
      "translation": "Redis 支持的核心功能可以直接使用，无需调用 Spring 容器的 IoC 服务。  \n这与 `<code>JdbcTemplate</code>` 类似，它可以“独立”使用，而无需依赖 Spring 容器的其他服务。  \n若要充分利用 Spring Data Redis 的所有功能（例如仓库支持），则需要配置该库的部分组件以启用 Spring。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To learn more about Spring, you can refer to the comprehensive documentation that explains the Spring Framework in detail.\nThere are a lot of articles, blog entries, and books on the subject.\nSee the Spring framework <a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-framework/\">home page</a> for more information.",
      "translation": "如需了解更多关于 Spring 的信息，您可以参考全面介绍 Spring 框架的详细文档。  \n该主题有大量文章、博客条目和书籍可供查阅。  \n有关更多信息，请参阅 Spring 框架<a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-framework/\">主页</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "NoSQL stores have taken the storage world by storm.\nIt is a vast domain with a plethora of solutions, terms, and patterns (to make things worse, even the term itself has multiple <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=nosql+acronym\">meanings</a>).\nWhile some of the principles are common, it is crucial that you be familiar to some degree with the stores supported by SDR. The best way to get acquainted with these solutions is to read their documentation and follow their examples.\nIt usually does not take more than five to ten minutes to go through them and, if you come from an RDBMS-only background, many times these exercises can be eye-openers.",
      "translation": "NoSQL 存储系统已席卷存储领域。这是一个广阔的领域，拥有众多解决方案、术语和模式（更糟糕的是，\"NoSQL\"这一术语本身就有多种<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=nosql+acronym\">含义</a>）。虽然其中一些原则是通用的，但熟悉 SDR 所支持的各类存储系统至关重要。了解这些解决方案的最佳方法是阅读其文档并参考其中的示例。通常只需五到十分钟即可完成浏览；如果您仅具备传统关系型数据库（RDBMS）的背景，那么这些练习往往能让您大开眼界。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "One can find various samples for key-value stores in the dedicated Spring Data example repo, at <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples/tree/main/redis\">https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples/</a>.",
      "translation": "您可以在专门的 Spring Data 示例仓库中找到各种键值存储的示例，地址为 <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples/tree/main/redis\">https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples/</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Redis binaries require JDK level 17 and above and <a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-framework/\">Spring Framework</a> 7.0.8 and above.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Redis 二进制文件需要 JDK 17 及以上版本以及<a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-framework/\">Spring Framework</a> 7.0.8 及以上版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In terms of key-value stores, <a href=\"https://redis.io\">Redis</a> 2.6.x or higher is required.\nSpring Data Redis is currently tested against the latest 6.0 release.",
      "translation": "在键值存储方面，需要 Redis 2.6.x 或更高版本。  \nSpring Data Redis 目前已在最新的 6.0 版本上进行测试。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data on <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-data\">Stack Overflow</a> is a tag for all Spring Data (not just Document) users to share information and help each other.\nNote that registration is needed only for posting.",
      "translation": "在 Stack Overflow 上的 <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/spring-data\">Spring Data</a> 标签是供所有 Spring Data（而不仅仅是文档）用户分享信息、互帮互助的专区。请注意，注册仅在发帖时需要。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For information on the Spring Data source code repository, nightly builds, and snapshot artifacts, see the Spring Data home <a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-data/\">page</a>.",
      "translation": "有关 Spring 数据源代码仓库、夜间构建和快照制品的信息，请参阅 Spring Data 主页<a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-data/\">页面</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you encounter a bug or want to suggest an improvement (including to this documentation), please create a ticket on <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-redis/issues/new\">Github</a>.",
      "translation": "如果您遇到任何错误或缺乏功能，或者希望提出改进建议（包括对本文档的改进），请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-redis/issues/new\">Github</a> 上创建一张工单。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To stay up to date with the latest news and announcements in the Spring eco system, subscribe to the Spring Community <a href=\"https://spring.io/\">Portal</a>.",
      "translation": "如需及时获取 Spring 生态系统的最新资讯和公告，请订阅 Spring 社区<a href=\"https://spring.io/\">门户</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Spring Data Redis project applies core Spring concepts to the development of solutions by using a key-value style data store.\nWe provide a “template” as a high-level abstraction for sending and receiving messages.\nYou may notice similarities to the JDBC support in the Spring Framework.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Redis 项目将核心 Spring 概念应用于基于键值存储的数据解决方案开发中。  \n我们提供了一个“模板”，作为发送和接收消息的高级抽象层。  \n您可能会注意到它与 Spring Framework 中的 JDBC 支持具有相似之处。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This section provides an easy-to-follow guide for getting started with the Spring Data Redis module.",
      "translation": "本节提供了一份易于遵循的指南，帮助您开始使用 Spring Data Redis 模块。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "While you need not know the Spring APIs, understanding the concepts behind them is important.\nAt a minimum, the idea behind Inversion of Control (IoC) should be familiar, and you should be familiar with whatever IoC container you choose to use.",
      "translation": "虽然您无需了解 Spring API，但理解其背后的概念至关重要。至少，您应该熟悉控制反转（IoC）的理念，并了解您所选择的任何 IoC 容器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In general, this should be the starting point for developers wanting to try Spring Data Redis.",
      "translation": "一般来说，这应该是希望尝试 Spring Data Redis 的开发者们的起点。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Learning a new framework is not always straightforward.\nIn this section, we try to provide what we think is an easy-to-follow guide for starting with the Spring Data Redis module.\nHowever, if you encounter issues or you need advice, feel free to use one of the following links:",
      "translation": "学习新框架并不总是轻而易举的。\n在本节中，我们尝试提供一份易于遵循的指南，帮助您开始使用 Spring Data Redis 模块。\n如果您遇到问题或需要建议，请随时使用以下链接之一：",
      "count": 1
    },
